#: scenario5:scenario5_3278D5C0_A12F_4186_96D9_B185A12BE12D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3416ed65649be9d500c68421c9aa684f63ebf8886976444d4cbb1fa078f8a370
