msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3278D5C0_A12F_4186_96D9_B185A12BE12D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We weren’t thinking. ⟪k:1⟫We stood alone in a frozen world, robbed of all rational thought."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫就在这一秒，⟪k:1⟫我和他，⟪k:2⟫或许什么都没有去想。⟪k:3⟫全世界都静止在了那一瞬间，⟪k:4⟫将我们"
"的思考能力全部夺走。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_02A77B9B_FC1E_472A_A6ED_32B97CFF6F3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a955929e1a4936f027dec51c232975c2cbaaecf7badad9c86e161336f27609de
