msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_02A77B9B_FC1E_472A_A6ED_32B97CFF6F3E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Riding the moonlight’s current, his hand fell against my cheek.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was much colder "
"than I had expected,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫他伸出手，⟪k:1⟫如同被月光指引着，⟪k:2⟫触碰到了我的脸颊。⟪k:3⟫让人吃惊的是，⟪k:4⟫他的指尖虽然"
"冰凉，但——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E05F5ED4_80BB_4F67_9BDF_F9C180B1D998
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3bc49136e2f3ce6238b7992691a5e438035173d3d17490139c1d53ca644ecd95
