msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E05F5ED4_80BB_4F67_9BDF_F9C180B1D998"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but it felt pleasant on my flushed skin."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫在我滚烫的脸颊上的触感，⟪k:1⟫异常地令人安心。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_03433850_C291_4A13_9D33_EB97118F6FA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 279665db83160b8f6369ac52a9fb94631cf85f966c9042b1792a7c8e230fec54
#. default-sha256: 5f56acc1a64c9eefdd6ce74aca339c37f330b21306421cb2795422cb12d2b0de
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_03433850_C291_4A13_9D33_EB97118F6FA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As we drew closer, I could feel the warmth emanating from his body, and I’m sure he could "
"feel mine. ⟪k:1⟫The beating of my heart too.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫His breathing stopped for a moment, then he "
"gulped."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫我们的距离越来越近。⟪k:1⟫随着空气，⟪k:2⟫彼此传递着体温。⟪k:3⟫连心跳都在发出共鸣。⟪k:4⟫他屏息"
"凝神，⟪k:5⟫喉咙里发出轻咽声，⟪k:6⟫已经明明白白地告诉我，⟪k:7⟫将发生什么。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_72D2410D_6DD9_449E_AB27_4AEBC7485B4F
